<title>UK: Orange year pretax loss widens.</title>
<headline>Orange year pretax loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to Dec 31 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		21 loss		vs 18 loss</p>
<p> Pretax		     229.1 loss	   vs 140.5 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   619		    vs 228.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax losses in a range between 237 and 223.3 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Orange Plc.</p>
